    "previous_guid": "0B85ACF084B411EC99D00A58A9FEAC02",
    "section": "",
    "section_color": "",
    "section_duration": 0,
    "is_substep": false,
    "step": "Add more hPSCs medium to the triturated colonies suspension to a proper dilution so that each MEFs wells will receive 2 ml. Splitting ratio varies between different cell lines and different operators. It\u2019s usually within a range of 1:6 to 1:20.",
    "data": null,
    "protocol_id": 57743,
    "case_id": 0,
    "critical_ids": "",
    "duration": 0,
    "original_id": 1329616,
    "number": "17",
    "cases": [],
    "critical": null
   },
   {
    "id": 1337193,
    "guid": "0B869CFE84B411EC99D00A58A9FEAC02",
    "previous_id": 1337192,
    "previous_guid": "0B86243A84B411EC99D00A58A9FEAC02",
    "section": "",
    "section_color": "",
    "section_duration": 0,
    "is_substep": false,
    "step": "Mix well, distribute 2 ml to each MEFs wells. \n\n\na. Use of 5 ml pipette to mix cell suspension is preferred as it has the widest bore size, but 10 ml can be used if the volume of cells to plate is large.\nb. When mixing, expel and take up the entire volume of medium and cells 2 - 3 times, then take 4 ml of cell suspension to plate two wells at a time.\nc. Repeat until all cells are plated.\n \n",
    "data": null,
    "protocol_id": 57743,
    "case_id": 0,
    "critical_ids": "",
    "duration": 0,
    "original_id": 1329617,
    "number": "18",
    "cases": [],
    "critical": null
   },
   {
    "id": 1337194,
    "guid": "0B8715EA84B411EC99D00A58A9FEAC02",
    "previous_id": 1337193,
    "previous_guid": "0B869CFE84B411EC99D00A58A9FEAC02",
    "section": "",
    "section_color": "",
    "section_duration": 0,
    "is_substep": false,
    "step": "Place the plate in the low oxygen incubator\n\n\na. Do not stack the plates more than two high, preferably leave them as single level.\nb. Spread the cells by moving the plate in left-right, then backward-forward motion.\nc. Repeat cycle 2 - 3 times.\nd. Give the plate a final jerking motion in the backward-forward direction as the last spreading motion.\ne. Close the door of the incubator gently as to not disturb the position of the cell clusters.\n \n",
    "data": null,
    "protocol_id": 57743,
    "case_id": 0,
    "critical_ids": "",
    "duration": 0,
    "original_id": 1329618,
    "number": "19",
    "cases": [],
    "critical": null
   },
   {
    "id": 1337195,
    "guid": "0B87907E84B411EC99D00A58A9FEAC02",
    "previous_id": 1337194,
    "previous_guid": "0B8715EA84B411EC99D00A58A9FEAC02",
    "section": "",
    "section_color": "",
    "section_duration": 0,
    "is_substep": false,
    "step": "From day 3, change 2-3 ml pre-warmed hPSCs medium for each well daily.",
    "data": null,
    "protocol_id": 57743,
    "case_id": 0,
    "critical_ids": "",
    "duration": 0,
    "original_id": 1329622,
    "number": "20",
    "cases": [],
    "critical": null
   },
   {
    "id": 1337196,
    "guid": "0B88082184B411EC99D00A58A9FEAC02",
    "previous_id": 1337195,
    "previous_guid": "0B87907E84B411EC99D00A58A9FEAC02",
    "section": "",
    "section_color": "",
    "section_duration": 0,
    "is_substep": false,
    "step": "When hPSC density reaches 50-70% confluency, passage again. We usually adjust the splitting ratio to passage every 7 days.",
    "data": null,
    "protocol_id": 57743,
    "case_id": 0,
    "critical_ids": "",
    "duration": 0,
    "original_id": 1329624,
    "number": "21",
    "cases": [],
    "critical": null
   },
   {
    "id": 1337315,
    "guid": "0B7D8DF484B411EC99D00A58A9FEAC02",
    "previous_id": 0,
    "previous_guid": null,
    "section": "",
    "section_color": "",
    "section_duration": 0,
    "is_substep": false,
    "step": "Check MEFs plates for suitability to receive passaged hPSCs prior to beginning. Refer to the &#34;Maintenance and inactivation of mouse embryonic fibroblasts (MEFs) as feeder cells for human pluripotent stem cell culture&#34; collection; dx.doi.org/10.17504/protocols.io.b4pbqvin",
    "data": null,
    "protocol_id": 57743,
    "case_id": 0,
    "critical_ids": "",
    "duration": 0,
    "original_id": 0,
    "number": "1",
    "cases": [],
    "critical": null
   },
   {
    "id": 1337316,
    "guid": "BBF3EE5084B711ECA60F07246AE7D2E3",
    "previous_id": 1337184,
    "previous_guid": "0B825E9684B411EC99D00A58A9FEAC02",
    "section": null,
    "section_color": null,
    "section_duration": 0,
    "is_substep": true,
    "step": "**hPSCs Medium**\n<table class=\"component-table\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n%s</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n%s\n</tbody>\n</table>\r\n     DMEM/F12      385 ml        Fetal Bovine   Serum (FBS)      75 ml        Knockout Serum Replacement      25 ml        L-Glutamine (100X)      5 ml        Penicillin &amp; Streptomycin (100X)      5 ml        MEM Non-Essential Amino Acids (100X)      5 ml        2-Mercaptoethanol (10,000X)      50 ul        Heat Stable Recombinant Human FGF2 (25ug/ml)*      80 ul   \n \n\n**L-Glutamine (100X)**\n<table class=\"component-table\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n%s</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n%s\n</tbody>\n</table>\r\n     L-Glutamine,   powder      14.6 g        MilliQ H2O      500 ml   \n \n**2-Mercaptoethanol (10,000X)**\n<table class=\"component-table\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n%s</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n%s\n</tbody>\n</table>\r\n     2-Mercaptoethanol      0.78 ml        MilliQ H2O      9.22 ml   \n \n \n**Heat Stable Recombinant Human FGF2 (25\u00b5g/ml)**\n<table class=\"component-table\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n%s</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n%s\n</tbody>\n</table>\r\n     Heat Stable Recombinant Human FGF2      500 ug        0.1% BSA      20 ml   \n ",
    "data": null,
    "protocol_id": 57743,
    "case_id": 0,
